## ESTRUCTURA DE CARPETAS
```
apps/
├── backend/src/
│   ├── controllers/    ← Solo HTTP: req → service → res
│   ├── services/       ← Lógica de negocio pura (sin req/res/next)
│   ├── models/         ← Mongoose 9.x schemas
│   ├── middlewares/    ← authenticate, authorize, validateBody, upload
│   ├── routes/         ← Mapeo URL + middlewares → controller
│   ├── common/
│   │   ├── errors/     ← AppError.ts, error-handler.ts
│   │   └── middlewares/← request-id, response interceptor
│   └── config/         ← db.ts, validate-env.ts, rate-limit.config.ts
├── frontend/
│   ├── app/            ← Next.js 16 App Router
│   │   ├── (auth)/     ← login, register, forgot-password
│   │   └── (dashboard)/← dashboard, orders, proposals, costs...
│   └── src/
│       ├── lib/http/   ← api-client, proxy, cookie-provider, server-auth
│       └── modules/    ← Feature-Sliced Design: orders/, dashboard/...
packages/
├── shared-types/src/schemas/ ← Zod 4.x (Single Source of Truth)
├── domain/src/               ← Roles RBAC, permisos
└── config/src/               ← Env vars validadas
```

## ROLES RBAC (8 exactos)
gerente | residente | HES | supervisor | operador | tecnico | administrativo | cliente

## ORDER STATE MACHINE
```
open → assigned → in_progress → on_hold → completed → closed
Excepciones: cancelled (desde open, assigned, on_hold)
Transiciones válidas:
  open:        [assigned, cancelled]
  assigned:    [in_progress, on_hold, cancelled]
  in_progress: [on_hold, completed]
  on_hold:     [in_progress, cancelled]
  completed:   [closed]
  closed:      []
  cancelled:   []
```

